{
  "title": "LUXR",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "The LUXR drum",
        "machine (M-VAVE FM-1",
        "firmware) as a sound",
        "generator: eight",
        "drum voices after",
        "the Sonic Potions",
        "LXR, each a synth",
        "layer and a sample",
        "layer, with drive,",
        "delay, reverb, a",
        "master filter, a",
        "compressor and a",
        "limiter.",
        "",
        "Move sequences it:",
        "put LUXR on a drum",
        "track and play the",
        "pads."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pads",
      "lines": [
        "Note map MOVE:",
        "Pads 1-8 (notes",
        "36-43): Kick, Snare,",
        "Clap, Cl Hat,",
        "Op Hat, Tom, Rim,",
        "Cymbal.",
        "Pads 9-16 (44-51):",
        "the same, accented.",
        "Velocity over 110",
        "accents too.",
        "",
        "Note map GM: General",
        "MIDI drum notes.",
        "Note map TONAL:",
        "every note plays",
        "Tonal Snd, C3 its",
        "own pitch.",
        "",
        "The closed hat",
        "chokes the open one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs & Shift",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Knob pages",
          "lines": [
            "LUXR (first page):",
            "1 Volume  2 Tune",
            "3 Decay   4 Filter",
            "5 Reso    6 Drive",
            "7 Delay return",
            "8 Reverb return",
            "",
            "A sound, page 1:",
            "its synth layer, as",
            "LUXR's EDIT: knobs",
            "1-4 row A, 5-8 the",
            "row B (SHIFT on",
            "LUXR).",
            "Page 2: sample layer",
            "Page 3: Level Pan",
            "Delay Reverb | Drive",
            "Attack Gate Release",
            "Page 4: LFO 1 | 2",
            "Page 5: Variation",
            "",
            "Shift + knob: fine."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Perform",
          "lines": [
            "LUXR page > Perform:",
            "the knobs as on",
            "LUXR, a row and its",
            "SHIFT row.",
            "",
            "Knob 1-8: row A",
            "Shift+knob: row B",
            "Jog: the sound",
            "Jog click: layer",
            "Pad: its sound",
            "Touch knob: value",
            "Back: out",
            "",
            "SOUND: synth layer",
            "Shift: sample layer",
            "MIX: Level Pan Dly",
            "Rev Drv Atk Gate Rel",
            "Shift: LFO 1 + 2",
            "KIT: Vol Tune Decay",
            "Filt Reso Drive",
            "Dly Rev returns",
            "Shift: Dly time",
            "Fdbk Size Damp",
            "Thresh Ratio",
            "Makeup Limiter"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Kits",
          "lines": [
            "The preset browser:",
            "Factory and the 13",
            "LUXR preset patches",
            "(their kits)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sounds",
          "lines": [
            "Each sound: 8 synth",
            "parameters (by its",
            "kind), the sample",
            "layer (sample,",
            "level,",
            "pitch, decay, start,",
            "tone, bend, synth",
            "level), level, pan,",
            "delay, reverb and",
            "drive sends, attack,",
            "gate, release, two",
            "LFOs synced to the",
            "tempo.",
            "Variation rolls the",
            "sound anew (0 = its",
            "factory sound)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Kit",
          "lines": [
            "Volume, Tune, Decay",
            "(all sounds), Output",
            "(+0/+3/+6 dB), Note",
            "Map, Tonal Snd, the",
            "master filter (- low",
            "pass, + high pass)",
            "and its resonance."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "FX",
          "lines": [
            "Drive & Reverb,",
            "Delay (tempo synced:",
            "1/8 to 3/4, mono,",
            "stereo, ping pong),",
            "Compressor, Limiter:",
            "as on LUXR."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
